apps/           where `make app` puts the app under test (not committed)
src/{{ package_name }}/
  driver/       capabilities from settings, driver factory
  screens/      one class per screen; methods are user actions
  settings.py   APP_* environment settings
tests/
  mobile/       live tests: need Appium and a device, skipped otherwise
  unit/         offline tests: capabilities, screen objects on a fake driver
